(1. LEARNING OBJECTIVES & OVERVIEW: The human body is a highly coordinated) Tj
T*
(biological system consisting of nine major organ systems working) Tj
T*
(harmoniously: Skeletal, Muscular, Circulatory, Respiratory, Digestive,) Tj
T*
(Excretory, Nervous, Endocrine, and Reproductive systems. Physical military) Tj
T*
(readiness requires a comprehensive understanding of physiological limits) Tj
T*
(and anatomical conditioning.) Tj
T*
() Tj
