(2. SKELETAL & MUSCULAR SYSTEMS: The human skeletal framework is composed of) Tj
T*
(206 bones. It serves three critical functions: providing structural) Tj
T*
(rigidity, protecting delicate internal organs \(such as the brain inside the) Tj
T*
(cranium and heart/lungs within the thoracic cage\), and acting as mechanical) Tj
T*
(levers for voluntary muscle groups. Physical training \(PT\), cross-country) Tj
T*
(marching, and obstacle courses build high bone mineral density and muscular) Tj
T*
(endurance.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
