T*
(by the four-chambered heart, circulating approximately 5 liters of) Tj
T*
(oxygenated blood per minute. The respiratory system exchanges oxygen and) Tj
T*
(carbon dioxide through 300 million pulmonary alveoli. Endurance marching) Tj
T*
(enhances maximum oxygen uptake \(VO2 max\), allowing cadets to march 20 km) Tj
T*
(under full battle load without acute lactic acidosis.) Tj
T*
() Tj
